{"version":1,"content":"<p>Linux 7.4開發版已合入一批Kbuild優化改動，針對內核編譯流程中的單線程瓶頸和重複工作提速。Kbuild是Linux內核的構建系統，負責組織配置、編譯和連結等步驟；相關改動由Arm工程師、長期內核開發者Lorenzo Stoakes提出。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583292.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:41.946810+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:55:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"f8f525a4e26c6e13e68b5b7a24c7befb9858deb565acfa16d02a560506163c80","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}